libsdl3 (3.4.20+ds-1vos1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Native V\OS video backend on BSurface.
  * Cursor shapes, custom cursors and text clipboard.
  * The backend is a module loaded on demand; libSDL3 no longer links libbe
    and libroot.

